     "body": "<p>Steps to reproduce:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>docker-compose up -d fcrepo</li>\n\t<li>docker-compose stop fcrepo</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>You should see errors in the log and the file `/var/lib/docker/volumes/fedora_fcrepo-home/_data/data/fcrepo-h2.lock.db` still present.</p>",
