     "body": "<p>The PR below was merged.  It prevents the tomcat serialization stacktrace by disabling session serialization/deserialization on shutdown/start up.</p>\n\n<p>The other issue with the h2 lock file I believe was resolved by other means which I can’t recall.</p>",
